B.aav=new A.X("20-Page Report -> 200-Word Brief","You received a 20-page operations report with charts and appendices. Your VP needs a 200-word brief that captures outcomes, 3 key findings, 2 risks, and the single recommendation to move forward.","Summarize this 20-page report in ~200 words: outcomes, 3 key findings, 2 risks, and 1 recommendation. Write for a VP.","This report shows on-time delivery improved from 84% to 93% after the scheduling change, with reduced overtime and fewer stockouts. Key findings: (1) Improved forecasting accuracy: MAPE down 7%. (2) Throughput up 12% in 3 sites; the 4th site remains constrained by staffing. (3) Supplier lead-time variability narrowed for 2 of 4 suppliers. Risks: (1) Hiring lag at Site D could stall gains. (2) Dependency on a single analytics vendor increases switching cost. Recommendation: scale the scheduling change to all sites in Q3 with a focus on Site D staffing and a backup analytics plan.","Define length and required sections so the summary is brief and decision-oriented.","Set a word limit and exact sections so AI compresses the document into decision-ready facts.",B.afR,B.J3)
