B.abH=new A.X("Research Paper -> 1-Page Summary","You were sent a dense academic paper (30 pages) on customer churn modeling with equations and methods. Your product team needs a plain-language 1-page summary they can act on.","Create a 1-page summary (<=300 words) of this research paper in plain language: objective, method, data used, top 3 findings, limitations, and product implications.","Objective: estimate and reduce customer churn using behavioral and billing signals. Method: gradient-boosted trees trained on 24 months of labeled churn outcomes; cross-validated AUC 0.86. Data: usage frequency, late payments, support tickets, contract terms. Findings: (1) Ticket severity and unresolved cases are strongest predictors; (2) Price increases without added value raise churn risk; (3) Feature adoption within first 14 days drops churn by 22%. Limitations: observational data and potential selection bias; no causal proof. Product implications: improve onboarding nudges for early feature adoption, implement proactive outreach for high-severity ticket accounts, and bundle value when prices change.","Guide AI to translate research into clear actions with method and limits stated.","Ask for plain language plus specific sections to bridge research to product decisions.",B.aek,B.Ll)
